@startuml agentic-offering-execution-boundary
title Agentic Offering Execution Boundary ; per ADR-ES-018 §11 + CR-ES-018 §3

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

start
:Stakeholder Intent;
:Interpret Context;
:Configure / Compose;
:Select / Coordinate;
:Fulfill;
:Observe Outcome;
if (Adapt?) then (yes)
  :Adapt;
elseif (Escalate?) then (yes)
  :Escalate;
endif

stop

note right
  Per ADR-ES-018 §9, the entire offering does NOT need
  to operate agentically. Mixed realization permitted.
end note

@enduml
